### Part 4: Blob Positioning & Morphing Configurations

Implement the responsive positioning offsets and filters for background and foreground morphing blobs:

```css
.nl-blob {
  position: absolute;
  overflow: hidden;
  will-change: border-radius, transform;
}

.nl-bg-blob {
  left: calc(var(--bg-center-x) - var(--bg-radius-x));
  top: calc(var(--bg-center-y) - var(--bg-radius-y));
  width: calc(var(--bg-radius-x) * 2);
  height: calc(var(--bg-radius-y) * 2);
  filter: blur(var(--bg-blur));
  animation: 
    morphBG var(--morph-speed) ease-in-out infinite,
    scaleBG calc(var(--morph-speed) * 1.3) ease-in-out infinite,
    sweepBG 6s cubic-bezier(0.76, 0, 0.24, 1) infinite;
}

.nl-fg-blob {
  left: calc(var(--fg-center-x) - var(--fg-radius-x));
  top: calc(var(--fg-center-y) - var(--fg-radius-y));
  width: calc(var(--fg-radius-x) * 2);
  height: calc(var(--fg-radius-y) * 2);
  filter: blur(var(--fg-blur));
  animation: 
    morphFG var(--morph-speed) ease-in-out infinite,
    rotateFG var(--fg-rotate-speed) ease-in-out infinite,
    scaleFG 9.1s ease-in-out -5.5s infinite,
    sweepFG 4.3s cubic-bezier(0.45, 0, 0.55, 1) -1.2s infinite;
}
```

