### Part 5: Animated Color-Changing Gradient Strip

Define the infinite looping linear gradient representing the active colors within each blob structure:

```css
.gradient-strip {
  position: absolute;
  inset: -150% -100%;
  width: 400%;
  height: 500%;
  transform: rotate(var(--uv-rotation));
  transform-origin: center center;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    180deg,
    #336ef3 0%,
    #9254ea 9%,
    #f63bb3 18%,
    #ed3733 27%,
    #ff6b2b 38%,
    #fec700 47%,
    #ffdb0f 56%,
    #57c200 65%,
    #00af57 74%,
    #009aaa 83%,
    #3279f9 92%,
    #336ef3 100%
  );
  background-size: 100% calc(var(--gradient-zoom) * 10px);
  animation: gradientScroll calc(var(--scroll-speed) * 999) linear infinite;
}
```

